	<entry name="DaBigZzap" value="Da Big Zzap"/>
	<entry name="DaBigZzapFlavor" value="With a wild scream and eyes blazing green, the Weirdboy channels the gathered Waaagh! into a crackling torrent of lightning. The air splits with a deafening roar as raw psychic energy lashes out, melting metal, searing flesh, and leaving nothing but scorched ruins and the smell of ozone in its wake. To the boyz, it’s just another good laugh—loud, bright, and very, very deadly."/>

