	<entry name="SkullsquirmBlight" value="Skullsquirm Blight"/>
	<entry name="SkullsquirmBlightFlavor" value="Grandfather Nurgle's most cherished gift—microscopic worms that dance through marrow and mind alike. Their joyous feast brings blessed decay to all who witness their divine hunger."/>

	<entry name="MagmaCutter" value="Magma Cutter"/>
	<entry name="MagmaCutterFlavor" value="Warp-fueled furnaces burn within the beast's mechanical heart, feeding torrents of liquid fire through baroque weapon arrays. The daemon's hunger for destruction flows as molten death."/>

	<entry name="DaemonClaws" value="Daemon Claws"/>
	<entry name="DaemonClawsFlavor" value="Twisted beyond mortal recognition, the Spawn’s claws drip with the raw essence of the Warp. Each frenzied swipe is a mindless act of destruction, rending flesh, armour, and even reality itself with lunatic strength."/>

	<entry name="DarkSorcery" value="Dark Sorcery"/>
	<entry name="DarkSorceryFlavor" value="Their whispered litanies corrupt the very air, as these devoted servants of Chaos weave dark magic through forbidden prayers to their malevolent gods."/>


