	<entry name="DigitalWeapons" value="Digital Weapons"/>
	<entry name="DigitalWeaponsDescription" value="These miniaturized energy emitters melt armor plating, and cripple engines in an instant."/>
	<entry name="DigitalWeaponsFlavor" value="Tiny yet lethal, these miniaturized energy emitters are concealed within the mechadendrites and augmetic limbs of the Tech-Priests. Guided by noospheric targeting algorithms and the Machine God's will, they unleash pinpoint blasts of phase-disruptive energy designed to overload vehicle systems, melt armor plating, and cripple engines in an instant."/>

