	<entry name="SkyFall" value="Sky Fall"/>
	<entry name="SkyFallFlavor" value="Savagely beautiful orbs of coruscating light plummet from the cold depths of space, growing to roaring bale-stars as they approach."/>
	<entry name="HellBreath" value="Hell Breath"/>
	<entry name="HellBreathFlavor" value="A torrent of psychic flames pour forth from the psyker's eyes and mouth, engulfing the target."/>
	<entry name="HellBeam" value="Hell Beam"/>
	<entry name="HellBeamFlavor" value="The Daemon summons a white-hot beam of blazing energy. It melts armour to slag and vaporises flesh, leaving only ghastly shadows in its wake."/>
